le  without jobs so when you start looking  at that's just one small pub in in a  small village uh the scale of of the  problem uh times that by you know 30 000  pubs and that's just hospitality never  mind your bakeries and your cafes and  your other small businesses um so v80  business rates holiday and a cap and  utilities would be a start but then i  think we've got to think about how do we  future-proof our businesses moving  forward um we unfortunately are very we  use a lot of energy we have fridges we  have ovens we have cooling systems we  have sellers uh there's got to be some  sort of long-term um idea of how we move  forward as a sector and what we get you  know are we gonna are they gonna enable  us to install green energy are we gonna  be able to install solar something just  to future-proof ourselves from this  happening again  thank you uh so much it's been really  interesting to talk to you this morning  abby uh and you know good luck in the  months ahead let's hope there's  something for you thank you sophie
 

